Neyra-AIAssist includes a native computer-use implementation adapted from
the accessibility snapshot and element-reference approach of agent-desktop.

agent-desktop
https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop
Upstream revision: 9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
Attribution: the agent-desktop project and its contributors.

The Neyra adaptation is in client/src-tauri/src/computer/. It selects a small
foreground-window accessibility tree, uses snapshot-scoped references and
native accessibility actions, and adds Neyra policy, confirmation,
cancellation, reference invalidation and sanitized error handling.
It does not include the full agent-desktop CLI or its Linux backend.

